        "# DS 2002 Midterm Project — Walmart Hurricane Analytics\n",
        "\n",
        "**Team analysis notebook | Fall 2026**\n",
        "\n",
        "This project analyzes Walmart transactions alongside historical weather observations to investigate demand changes, product-name inconsistencies, differences among stores, and possible data-quality artifacts. We compare **September 1–10, 2024** with **September 11–20, 2024** as the analysis windows used in the team's progress work. These dates are **not independently verified as hurricane impact dates**.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Reproducibility:** Run all cells in order. Place `walmart_transactions.csv` (or `walmart_transactions (1).csv`) in the repository `data/` folder, notebook directory, or Colab working directory. Weather analysis requires internet access to Open-Meteo."
      ]
